{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BLANK CANVAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in an empty world, and it is up to you to fill it with life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover adorable creatures and other surprises as you breathe life into your growing garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY &amp; DISCOVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming minigames and hidden secrets are scattered throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play minigames and solve little puzzles to unlock new colours, decorations and minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/64bd5b3ccd7e77b7b717c0aac65b335c.poster.avif?t=1772625143\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/64bd5b3ccd7e77b7b717c0aac65b335c.webm?t=1772625143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/64bd5b3ccd7e77b7b717c0aac65b335c.mp4?t=1772625143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u> </u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MERGE &amp; DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decoration can be combined and arranged in multiple ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many possibilities, you have the freedom to design your garden just the way you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and many combinations bring little secrets with them:)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/619596da47a684385065255590e7a76b.poster.avif?t=1772625143\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/619596da47a684385065255590e7a76b.webm?t=1772625143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/619596da47a684385065255590e7a76b.mp4?t=1772625143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PAINT YOUR WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your personal coloring book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new palettes and paint everything to make the world feel truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/4bd79a4cc484c2fc4fa0056704f88030.poster.avif?t=1772625143\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/4bd79a4cc484c2fc4fa0056704f88030.webm?t=1772625143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/4bd79a4cc484c2fc4fa0056704f88030.mp4?t=1772625143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the soft music, playful sounds, and calm atmosphere invite you to stay a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Ink</strong> is a cozy world made for slowing down and simply enjoying the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/73e3cf1a6cd9a4a576742859a19e0349.poster.avif?t=1772625143\" width=1100 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421740/extras/73e3cf1a6cd9a4a5767428